<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρῑμ-άσσομαι</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρί̄μ-ττομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snort and leap: wanton,</i> of
			goats, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.141
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.558
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Eryc.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.88
			</span></i>; of high-mettled horses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φριμάξασθαι καὶ χρεμετίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.87
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.281
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσιόντος ἐφριμάττετο καὶ
					ἐπικροτοῦντος ἐφρυάττετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					6.44
				</span></i>
			 (the distinctions drawn by <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.87
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>Diff.</u>
				p.138
			</span></i> V. do not hold good).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
